  "L2VA for fast iteration with a final image; FL2VA for exact before/after; T2VA for pure-text; I2VA to lock the start site.": "有完工图快速迭代用 L2VA；前后对比严格用 FL2VA；纯文用 T2VA；锁定起始地用 I2VA。",
